Package: Lynch
Type: Package
Title: A David Lynch Palette Generator
Version: 0.4.0
Authors@R:
    person("Georgios", "Karamanis", , "georgios@karaman.is", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Colour palettes from David Lynch films, with colour-blind-safe
    variants, sequential and diverging ramps, and colour-blindness test
    results for every discrete palette.
